Z||000009||Richard Parnell||04-04-2000||01:51 PM||||Gokart-  What is that about changing the the screws with compatible nuts?  Let me know details so I can have the replacements on hand before taking everything apart.  Thanks.||||reg||5
Z||000010||Gokart||04-04-2000||09:09 PM||||Sorry! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"> didn't mean to say "nuts"! I replaced them with screws with metric heads on them. Wish I could remember exactly what size, but I simply took a screw with me to the hardware store and found a nut that it fit into perfectly, then matched up screws with metric heads for replacement. This way next time it will be MUCH easier to get to them with a small wrench instead of a special tool. GM really "screwed" us on easy replacement with those wipes! ||||reg||1
